4. Common Risks
Generative AI & LLM Risks: Unverified AI outputs, hallucinations, algorithmic bias, data privacy breaches, lack of human oversight, and misrouting sensitive operational escalations
.
Conversational Design Failures: Broken user journeys, missing fallback responses, uncaptured entity parameters, and failure to integrate inclusive or accessible design features
.
Cloud Security & Configuration Gaps: Infrastructure misconfigurations, improper identity and access management (IAM), missing audit logs, and misunderstandings of shared responsibility boundaries
.
Logistical & Submission Risks: Submitting broken links for the video or GitHub repo, exceeding the 2-minute video cutoff, missing required AI acknowledgement forms, or omitting prompt JSON fields
.
